  "description": "Knock, knock—\n\n\"You're here?\"\n\nMy friend only visits me in the middle of the night, when everyone else is fast asleep.   \nEvery time he leaves, there's always a piece of candy waiting for me.\n\n'Why won't he ever show himself to me?'\n\nAs my growing curiosity slowly turns into disappointment, I finally gather the courage to try something daring.  \nI'll pretend to be in danger so I can finally meet him face-to-face!   \nBut what appears before my eyes is...   \n\n\"...A shadow?\"\n\nAs if discovering that my longtime friend is actually a shadow isn't shocking enough, Duke Verlite, renowned throughout the empire for his handsome looks, suddenly comes looking for me.\n\n\"So it's you. The thief who stole my shadow.\"\n\nAnd he looks absolutely furious.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1632014070)",
